Federal records - fixtures/federal/
-----------------------------------

Snapshots of United States government data, retrieved from the NHTSA vPIC API
and NHTSA's recall and complaint endpoints. US government works are not subject
to copyright. They are committed so that a fixture run needs no network, and
every file's origin and retrieval date is recorded in fixtures/PROVENANCE.md.

This is the one part of the fixture that is real. The VIN it decodes is a
documentation VIN - real manufacturer codes with an invented serial - so it
resolves to a real model and identifies no vehicle and no person.

Anthropic API
-------------

